### 1. Metadados e Diagnóstico do Serviço
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/diagnostico/modelo
User-Agent: Tester-Audit-Agent
Accept: application/json

### 2. Predição com Perfil A (Alto Risco Cardíaco -> "Risco Cardíaco")
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict
User-Agent: Tester-Audit-Agent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Age": 62,
  "Sex": "M",
  "ChestPainType": "ASY",
  "RestingBP": 150,
  "Cholesterol": 289,
  "FastingBS": 1,
  "RestingECG": "ST",
  "MaxHR": 108,
  "ExerciseAngina": "Y",
  "Oldpeak": 2.6,
  "ST_Slope": "Flat"
}

### 3. Predição com Perfil B (Baixo Risco / Paciente Saudável -> "Normal")
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict
User-Agent: Tester-Audit-Agent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Age": 34,
  "Sex": "F",
  "ChestPainType": "ATA",
  "RestingBP": 118,
  "Cholesterol": 195,
  "FastingBS": 0,
  "RestingECG": "Normal",
  "MaxHR": 174,
  "ExerciseAngina": "N",
  "Oldpeak": 0.0,
  "ST_Slope": "Up"
}

### 4. Predição com Entrada Inválida (Validação Pydantic -> Erro HTTP 422)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict
User-Agent: Tester-Audit-Agent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Age": "idade_invalida",
  "Sex": "X",
  "ChestPainType": "ASY",
  "RestingBP": 500,
  "Cholesterol": 240,
  "FastingBS": 0,
  "RestingECG": "Normal",
  "MaxHR": 150,
  "ExerciseAngina": "N",
  "Oldpeak": 0.5,
  "ST_Slope": "Up"
}